      },
      "message": "fix(kernel): project spline mesh deviation and certify between-sample bounds\n\nProvoke every solidcore-tess PlanStats shortfall through machining_mesh, judge spline and revolved faces by orthogonal projection onto the plan surface with a clean-room STEP fixture, and certify continuous between-sample triangle deviation bounds using Voronoi/radial-dip analytic bounds and de Boor blossom-restricted NURBS/revolved Hessian bounds with adaptive sub-triangle refinement.\n\nFixes #1029",
